"``OPENMV4P``, ``ARDUINO_GIGA``, ``ARDUINO_PORTENTA_H7``, and "
"``ARDUINO_NICLA_VISION`` in addition to ``OPENMV_AE3`` and ``OPENMV_N6``."
msgstr ""
"**STMicroelectronics model zoo** katalog proširen na ``OPENMV_RT1060``\\ , "
"``OPENMV4P``\\ , ``ARDUINO_GIGA``\\ , ``ARDUINO_PORTENTA_H7`` i "
"``ARDUINO_NICLA_VISION`` uz ``OPENMV_AE3`` i ``OPENMV_N6``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.4.rst:87
msgid "Breaking changes"
msgstr "Nekompatibilne promjene"

